---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Sammy Agrawal" description="About Sammy Agrawal.">
	<main class="app-container pt-36">
		<h1 class="text-6xl pb-2 font-bold">About Me</h1>
	</main>
	<section class="app-container py-12 mb-8">
		<div
			class="prose prose-neutral prose-lg md:prose-xl dark:prose-invert prose-img:rounded-xl prose-figure:text-center prose-img:mx-auto"
		>
			<p>
				Hi, I'm Sammy. I'm a Machine Learning Engineer at
				<a href="https://genbio.ai/">Genbio AI</a> and I'm interested in simulating science with
				AI. Outside of Genbio I work on hybrid physics-climate modeling with Tian Zheng at the
				LEAP Institute. I'm based in San Francisco.
			</p>
			<p>
				This site is a place for me to think out loud. <a href="/notes/">Notes</a> are
				summaries and annotations from things I'm reading — papers, textbooks, books, whatever I
				want to remember. <a href="/writing/">Writing</a> is where I try to develop and share my
				own beliefs, building on what's in the notes. <a href="/projects/">Projects</a> are the
				interactive end — demos, animations, small apps that show something I find interesting.
			</p>
			<p>
				If you'd like to get in touch, I'm reachable at samarth dot agrawal at genbio dot ai or
				via the social links in the footer. I'm in SF and looking to meet new people.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
